{"seq":2,"slug":"code-quality-tools","title":"代码质量工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/testing-and-quality/code-quality-tools","wordCount":660,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"代码质量工具\">代码质量工具</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Monorepo 代码质量治理的核心方法是<strong>共享配置包 + 分层继承</strong>——把工具配置也当作可复用的包：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>载体</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>统一基线</td>\n<td>所有包共享的一套基础规则</td>\n<td><code>@myorg/eslint-config/base</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>差异化扩展</td>\n<td>按包类型叠加专用规则</td>\n<td><code>/react</code>、<code>/node</code>、<code>/library</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量检查</td>\n<td>只对暂存区文件执行检查</td>\n<td>lint-staged</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键在于<strong>统一与差异的平衡</strong>：不同类型的包（React 组件 vs Node 服务）需要不同规则，但又不能各写一套。共享配置包用分层继承解决——基础规则定义一次，各类型在其上叠加。提交规范（commitlint + Conventional Commits）是另一条支柱，它既统一了提交信息，又为自动化版本管理提供推断依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-中的代码质量治理\">Monorepo 中的代码质量治理</h2><p>代码质量工具在 Monorepo 中面临独特挑战：不同类型的包需要不同的规则集（React 组件 vs Node.js 服务），但又需要一套统一的基线规范。解决方案是<strong>共享配置包</strong> + <strong>分层继承</strong>——在工具链层将 ESLint、Prettier、commitlint 等工具的配置抽象为可复用的包。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    BASE[&quot;@myorg/eslint-config&lt;br/&gt;基础规则&quot;]&#10;    REACT[&quot;@myorg/eslint-config/react&lt;br/&gt;React 规则&quot;]&#10;    NODE[&quot;@myorg/eslint-config/node&lt;br/&gt;Node.js 规则&quot;]&#10;    LIB[&quot;@myorg/eslint-config/library&lt;br/&gt;库规则&quot;]&#10;&#10;    BASE --&gt; REACT&#10;    BASE --&gt; NODE&#10;    BASE --&gt; LIB&#10;&#10;    REACT --&gt; WEB[&quot;apps/web&quot;]&#10;    REACT --&gt; ADMIN[&quot;apps/admin&quot;]&#10;    NODE --&gt; API[&quot;apps/api&quot;]&#10;    LIB --&gt; UI[&quot;packages/ui&quot;]&#10;    LIB --&gt; UTILS[&quot;packages/utils&quot;]\">graph TB\n    BASE[\"@myorg/eslint-config&lt;br/&gt;基础规则\"]\n    REACT[\"@myorg/eslint-config/react&lt;br/&gt;React 规则\"]\n    NODE[\"@myorg/eslint-config/node&lt;br/&gt;Node.js 规则\"]\n    LIB[\"@myorg/eslint-config/library&lt;br/&gt;库规则\"]\n\n    BASE --&gt; REACT\n    BASE --&gt; NODE\n    BASE --&gt; LIB\n\n    REACT --&gt; WEB[\"apps/web\"]\n    REACT --&gt; ADMIN[\"apps/admin\"]\n    NODE --&gt; API[\"apps/api\"]\n    LIB --&gt; UI[\"packages/ui\"]\n    LIB --&gt; UTILS[\"packages/utils\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"eslint-共享配置\">ESLint 共享配置</h2><p>创建一个共享的 ESLint 配置包，使用 flat config 格式（ESLint v9+）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// tooling/eslint-config/base.ts&#10;import type { Linter } from &#39;eslint&#39;;&#10;import eslint from &#39;@eslint/js&#39;;&#10;import tseslint from &#39;typescript-eslint&#39;;&#10;&#10;const config: Linter.Config[] = [&#10;  eslint.configs.recommended,&#10;  ...tseslint.configs.recommended,&#10;  {&#10;    rules: {&#10;      &#39;no-console&#39;: &#39;warn&#39;,&#10;      &#39;@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars&#39;: [&#39;error&#39;, { argsIgnorePattern: &#39;^_&#39; }],&#10;      &#39;@typescript-eslint/consistent-type-imports&#39;: [&#39;error&#39;, { prefer: &#39;type-imports&#39; }],&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    ignores: [&#39;dist/**&#39;, &#39;node_modules/**&#39;, &#39;.turbo/**&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;];&#10;&#10;export default config;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tooling/eslint-config/base.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Linter } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'eslint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eslint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@eslint/js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tseslint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'typescript-eslint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Linter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  eslint.configs.recommended,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tseslint.configs.recommended,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rules: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'no-console'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'warn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { argsIgnorePattern: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^_'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '@typescript-eslint/consistent-type-imports'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { prefer: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type-imports'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ignores: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dist/**'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'node_modules/**'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.turbo/**'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config;</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// tooling/eslint-config/react.ts&#10;import type { Linter } from &#39;eslint&#39;;&#10;import baseConfig from &#39;./base&#39;;&#10;import reactPlugin from &#39;eslint-plugin-react&#39;;&#10;import hooksPlugin from &#39;eslint-plugin-react-hooks&#39;;&#10;&#10;const config: Linter.Config[] = [&#10;  ...baseConfig,&#10;  {&#10;    plugins: {&#10;      react: reactPlugin,&#10;      &#39;react-hooks&#39;: hooksPlugin,&#10;    },&#10;    rules: {&#10;      &#39;react/jsx-key&#39;: &#39;error&#39;,&#10;      &#39;react-hooks/rules-of-hooks&#39;: &#39;error&#39;,&#10;      &#39;react-hooks/exhaustive-deps&#39;: &#39;warn&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;    settings: {&#10;      react: { version: &#39;detect&#39; },&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;];&#10;&#10;export default config;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tooling/eslint-config/react.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Linter } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'eslint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseConfig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './base'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reactPlugin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'eslint-plugin-react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hooksPlugin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'eslint-plugin-react-hooks'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Linter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">baseConfig,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    plugins: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      react: reactPlugin,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'react-hooks'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: hooksPlugin,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rules: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'react/jsx-key'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'react-hooks/rules-of-hooks'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'react-hooks/exhaustive-deps'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'warn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    settings: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      react: { version: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'detect'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span 