"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@commitlint/config-conventional\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^19.0.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# .husky/commit-msg&#10;npx --no -- commitlint --edit $1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .husky/commit-msg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --no</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commitlint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --edit</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> $1</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"lint-staged-增量检查\">lint-staged 增量检查</h2><p><strong>lint-staged</strong> 只对暂存区（staged）的文件执行检查，避免全量 lint 的耗时：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;lint-staged&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;*.{ts,tsx}&quot;: [&quot;eslint --fix&quot;, &quot;prettier --write&quot;],&#10;    &quot;*.{json,md,yml}&quot;: [&quot;prettier --write&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lint-staged\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"*.{ts,tsx}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eslint --fix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prettier --write\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"*.{json,md,yml}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prettier --write\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# .husky/pre-commit&#10;npx lint-staged\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .husky/pre-commit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint-staged</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 Monorepo 中，lint-staged 应配置在根目录。它会自动根据变更文件的路径调用对应的 lint 规则。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((代码质量工具))&#10;    ESLint&#10;      共享配置包&#10;      flat config&#10;      分层继承&#10;    Biome&#10;      Rust 高性能&#10;      lint + format&#10;      单一工具&#10;    Prettier&#10;      统一格式化&#10;      根目录配置&#10;      format:check&#10;    提交规范&#10;      commitlint&#10;      Conventional Commits&#10;      husky hooks\">mindmap\n  root((代码质量工具))\n    ESLint\n      共享配置包\n      flat config\n      分层继承\n    Biome\n      Rust 高性能\n      lint + format\n      单一工具\n    Prettier\n      统一格式化\n      根目录配置\n      format:check\n    提交规范\n      commitlint\n      Conventional Commits\n      husky hooks</pre><ul>\n<li>Monorepo 代码质量治理的核心是&quot;统一基线 + 差异化扩展&quot;，通过共享配置包实现</li>\n<li>ESLint flat config 使配置共享更加简洁，通过数组合并实现规则叠加</li>\n<li>Biome 以极快的速度提供 lint + format 一体化方案，适合对生态插件依赖不强的项目</li>\n<li>commitlint + husky 确保提交信息的规范性，为自动化版本管理提供基础</li>\n<li>lint-staged 只检查暂存文件，避免全量 lint 的性能问题</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代码质量工具","id":"代码质量工具"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo 中的代码质量治理","id":"monorepo-中的代码质量治理"},{"level":2,"text":"ESLint 共享配置","id":"eslint-共享配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Biome 作为替代方案","id":"biome-作为替代方案"},{"level":2,"text":"Prettier 格式化配置","id":"prettier-格式化配置"},{"level":2,"text":"commitlint 提交规范","id":"commitlint-提交规范"},{"level":2,"text":"lint-staged 增量检查","id":"lint-staged-增量检查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"测试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/testing-and-quality/testing-strategy"},"next":{"title":"CI 流水线设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/testing-and-quality/ci-pipeline-design"}}